    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of compliance with relevant EU regulations, we have administrative attestations available and can provide standard administrative attestations required for French public procurement, including those related to GDPR and HDS compliance. we professional liability insurance covers up to 10 million euros per claim, providing additional assurance in case of any potential risks or liabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, based on we context, it appears we are well-positioned to comply with the relevant EU regulations, including GDPR and the EU AI Act, while also mitigating potential legal risks associated with the development and deployment of an AI-powered assistance tool for healthcare applications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client's global budget is 900,000 over 5 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Annual operating costs must remain controlled and compatible with the authority's budgetary capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and current financial position, what is our projected margin on this contract, and are there any cost-optimisation strategies our can propose to improve our competitiveness? our financials indicate that our have a near break-even result with an annual revenue of €6,200,000. our also have a Series A funding of €12,000,000, which provides our with a comfortable cash runway." ;
