        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk149> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given The client's emphasis on controlled annual operating costs, one potential cost-optimisation strategy is to propose a solution that leverages our more cost-efficient tiers or models, such as the sovereign HDS tier and the sovereign European model, which are mentioned in our budget envelope context as being more cost-efficient on the recurring side." ;
