    <http://example.org/node/chunk151> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Another strategy is to work closely with the client to understand the client specific requirements and identify areas where our can optimize resource allocation, streamline processes, or implement more efficient technologies to reduce costs without compromising the quality of service." ;
