        ex:hasText "What sustainability measures do we need to implement to meet these requirements, and what CSR benefits can we highlight in we proposal?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk168> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the client's requirements, we can implement several sustainability measures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk169> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a company, we has already published a trajectory to reduce carbon intensity per managed assistant year on year, which demonstrates we commitment to reducing energy consumption. we can also highlight that we green hosting partner, OuraneCloud, uses renewable energy and has a power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.2, indicating efficient energy use." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk17> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision may be automated. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of care." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk170> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we practice digital sobriety through model right-sizing, caching, and batching, which helps reduce energy consumption. we can propose hosting the solution on our green hosting partner, OuraneCloud sovereign European infrastructure, which not only reduces the environmental footprint but also ensures data sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

