    <http://example.org/node/chunk176> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our consortium is pleased to submit a proposal for the implementation of an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution for hospital staff at the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB). an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution for hospital staff at the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) aims to improve the efficiency of staff and the quality and safety of care delivered to patients, aligning with the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) goals." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

