        ex:hasText "Our consortium project management methodology follows a Hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure suited to public and health procurement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk178> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our consortium propose a phased approach, starting with a pilot phase on a limited perimeter (one or two departments) followed by progressive generalization to all services. a phased approach aligns with the client's requirements and allows for effective change management and staff training. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution for hospital staff at the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) will provide hospital staff with an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from hospital staff work environment, capable of supporting hospital staff in hospital staff clinical-administrative activities. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution for hospital staff at the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) will assist in retrieving information from internal procedures, care protocols, and applicable regulations, as well as drafting medical and administrative documents. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution for hospital staff at the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) will also support handling dossiers, including admissions, coding, and medico-social pathways." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk179> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution for hospital staff at the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) meets the client's requirements, Our consortium will integrate an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution for hospital staff at the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) with the existing hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk18> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must facilitate the continuity of care between professionals and services by enabling relevant information sharing, an understanding of the context of an in-progress patient pathway, and an efficient resumption of handling by another professional. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

