    <http://example.org/node/chunk181> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our consortium also guarantee an availability target of 99.9%, ensuring continuity of care. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution for hospital staff at the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) is designed to comply with all relevant regulatory requirements, including GDPR, health data hosting (HDS), and medical confidentiality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

